)[Public opinion in the North is growing increasingly anti-slavery, with gradually more extreme demands. The public demands far more than the Missouri compromise, but some propose immediate emancipation of all slaves. Leading figures are writers, some are liberated slaves such as Douglas. The North Star and the Liberator are prominent journals.  ])

